1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,960
You guys can grab a seat.

2
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:06,240
Well, that was better than any sermon I'm gonna preach,

3
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:10,080
so we'll keep it short this morning.

4
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:10,740
How's that sound?

5
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:13,020
I think I owe you guys like 20 minutes too

6
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:14,700
because I brought a guest speaker in last week

7
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:17,080
and, you know, he hasn't preached in a while,

8
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:19,560
so hour, 10 minutes, it's fine, it's fine.

9
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:20,560
We had a good time, didn't we?

10
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:24,100
We had a good time, we had a time of prayer at the end,

11
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,200
and I do wanna remind you,

12
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:26,600
I know some of you were uncomfortable

13
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:28,160
with the time of prayer at the end,

14
00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:30,280
breaking into small groups in the middle of a church service.

15
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:32,400
Again, if that made you uncomfortable,

16
